# Cart Bridge JP development: wp-env mounts this repository root at wp-content/cbjp-dev so that the containers can run
# the root PHPUnit, bin/ and the .claude/skills PHP. The root holds local credentials (colorme.env) and rehearsal output
# with customer data, and wp-env listens on 0.0.0.0. Never serve it over HTTP (bin/check-dev-mount.sh verifies the 403).
Require all denied
